<title>THAILAND: Thai Danu, Finance One share suspension extended.</title>
<headline>Thai Danu, Finance One share suspension extended.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand on Monday said it had extended suspension of trading in shares of Thai Danu Bank Plc and Finance One Plc indefinitely.</p>
<p>The suspension was extended despite reports filed by both the companies to the bourse saying that their planned mega-merger had failed. The news of the collapse of the merger came last Friday.</p>
